NNAAMMEE
     yyppccaatt — print the values of all keys in a NIS database

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     yyppccaatt [--kktt] [--dd _d_o_m_a_i_n_n_a_m_e] _m_a_p_n_a_m_e
     yyppccaatt --xx

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The yyppccaatt utility prints out the values of all keys from the NIS database
     specified by _m_a_p_n_a_m_e, which may be a map name or a map nickname.

     The options are as follows:

     --dd _d_o_m_a_i_n_n_a_m_e
             Specify a domain other than the default domain.

     --kk      Display map keys.  This option is useful with maps in which the
             values are null or the key is not part of the value.

     --tt      Inhibit translation of map nicknames to their corresponding map
             names.

     --xx      Display the map nickname table.

